const SETUP_STEPS=[['Who are you?','Upload a picture, or choose who you will play.'],['Choose a scene.','A picture, a looping video, or a 3D world you can walk.'],['Who will you meet?','Choose them, or bring your own: a photo, a video or a 3D model. Then give them a voice.'],['Your story.','Plan it yourself, or let Auto outline it. Add as many chapters as you like.']];
